1
00:00:00,138 --> 00:00:01,638
(Howard:)Where's this coming from?

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:04,070
(Howard:)A few hours ago,
we both loved this song.

3
00:00:04,075 --> 00:00:05,405
(Raj:)I still love it.

4
00:00:05,410 --> 00:00:07,340
(Raj:)I just think there's
room for improvement.

5
00:00:07,345 --> 00:00:10,015
(Howard:)You played it for Emily,
didn't you?

6
00:00:10,015 --> 00:00:11,685
(Raj:)Yeah, so what?
You are such a wimp.

7
00:00:11,683 --> 00:00:14,283
(Howard:)She didn't like it,
now you don't like it.

8
00:00:14,286 --> 00:00:17,316
(Raj:)No, no. I'm just evolving
as a musician.

9
00:00:17,322 --> 00:00:19,992
(Raj:)You're the one who's stuck
in the past.

10
00:00:19,991 --> 00:00:22,761
The past was lunch!

11
00:00:24,696 --> 00:00:26,366
(Leonard:)You know
what's really happening here?

12
00:00:26,364 --> 00:00:29,434
(Howard:)Your girlfriend
is breaking up our band.

13
00:00:30,869 --> 00:00:32,199
(Raj:)She has nothing to do with this.

14
00:00:32,203 --> 00:00:33,503
(Raj:)I am my own man.

15
00:00:33,505 --> 00:00:34,905
(Howard:)Oh, please. Your brain belongs

16
00:00:34,906 --> 00:00:37,136
(Howard:)to whoever's willing
to sleep with you.

17
00:00:37,142 --> 00:00:38,372
(Raj:)That is so not true.
Really?

18
00:00:38,376 --> 00:00:39,846
(Howard:)Remember when you were gonna
get circumcised

19
00:00:39,844 --> 00:00:41,974
(Howard:)for Rachel Bernstein?

20
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:44,480
(Raj:)That had nothing to do
with Rachel.

21
00:00:44,482 --> 00:00:47,482
(Raj:)It was an overreaction
to a bad zipper injury.

22
00:00:50,422 --> 00:00:51,822
(Howard:)I don't need this.

23
00:00:51,823 --> 00:00:53,923
I'm quitting the band!

24
00:00:53,925 --> 00:00:55,225
Fine, I quit, too!

25
00:00:55,226 --> 00:00:56,696
Then get out of my house!

26
00:00:56,695 --> 00:01:01,025
With pleasure!

